Z||000017||FieroGT 914||09-19-2001||11:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 1FST2M6:<BR><B>Lotus Commerative Chrome Orange Incan Pearl,<BR>F0262/HE01 (ornage, with gold and blue pearl)<P>or a close touch up paint Ford Electric Tangerine with PL93, Code CM<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstmeat2.jpg">  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>wow 1FST... that car is beautiful!!!  it definitely makes me lean toward painting my 87 orange too.  if you can tell me, what engine do you have in it that's gettin you 12.92's?!?! that's awesome!!!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Joe<P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.worldlynx.net/asittingduck/FieroGT/Signature.jpg">       <BR>AOL I.M.: FieroGT 914<BR>White 86 1/2 GT (Stock)<BR>Maroon 87 GT (Mod)||||reg||14
