Z||000020||1FST2M6||09-20-2001||09:26 AM||||Since i used to work for Akzo-Nobel parent company to Sikkens Coatings i got the paint for free. I had to pay for the pearls (blue and gold just over $600. i did the shaving (emblems, antenna) and fixed hole in rear 1/4 [about the size of a quarter] anywho... $2600 is what i have in the paint work  you can get Maaco or somthing similar to do the job for probly under a grand. Chuck Williard had his done LIME green for well under a grand and it looks killer.  <P>just tell em ford code CM most shops hear Lotus and shy away cause not to many have the paint codes for exotics. (i got it from a friend of my dads that owns a Lotus dealership) <A HREF="http://www.paulspruell.com" TARGET=_blank>www.paulspruell.com</A>  <P>oh uum stock engine (bottom end), shaved heads, 2.5" exhaust, intake out of the trunk, ignition changes, chip, injectors lots of stuff and 52/35 nitrous jetting (279hp 312lbft at the wheels) 1.8 60' times on 18" radials.   <P>Thanks guys!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||1
